# Ignore generated and local-only files.
#
# `/data/` is ANCHORED to the repository root on purpose. An unanchored `data/`
# matches a directory of that name at ANY depth — including `server/data/`,
# which holds the species catalogue, the image manifest and the pins file. That
# silently produced a repository with no data in it, and the CI build would have
# failed on a checkout that looked complete.
node_modules/
/data/
/shots/
*.log

# The static build output. It is built from source in CI on every push, so
# committing it would only create a second copy that can drift from the code
# that produced it.
/dist/

# A working note about this project written outside this repository, and stale
# (it predates the photography work). Not part of the deliverable, so it stays
# on disk and out of the published source.
muse-ad-brief.md

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
